I'd rather make a small private static helper to avoid duplication:

```php
private static function binaryPlacementUiEnabled(): bool
{
    return setting('commissions_enabled', '1') === '1'
        && setting('commission_binary_enabled', '1') === '1'
        && setting('packages_disabled', '0') !== '1'
        && !empty(Package::all(true));
}
```

But that runs Package::all twice. In showRegister $packages already loaded; in doRegister $packagesAll loaded. Pass as param:

